Appendix B: Complete TLA+ Specification

B.1 Module Declaration and Constants

```tla
MODULE PONACommitProtocol
EXTENDS Integers, Sequences, FiniteSets, TLC

CONSTANTS
  Actions,          \* Set of possible actions
  Kappa,            \* Set of idempotency keys
  Results,          \* Set of possible results
  TrustLevels,      \* {QUARANTINED, UNTRUSTED, OBSERVED, VALIDATED, PERSISTENT}
  AuthorityLevels,  \* {NONE, ADVISORY, AUTHORIZED, POLICY_CHANGING}
  MaxLedgerLength

VARIABLES
  ledger,           \* Sequence of committed events
  iota,             \* Idempotency window: Kappa -> {not_applied, in_progress, applied, unknown}
  memory,           \* Memory store: entries with trust and authority states
  policy,           \* Authorization policy state
  pc                \* Program counter for protocol phases
```

B.2 Operator Definitions

```tla
\* Hash function (abstract, injective on distinct inputs)
Hash(e) == e.seq

\* Append an event to the ledger with hash chaining
Append(ledger, event) ==
  Append(ledger, [event EXCEPT !.prev_hash = IF Len(ledger) = 0
                                              THEN 0
                                              ELSE Hash(ledger[Len(ledger)])])

\* Policy evaluation (abstract, returns Allow, Deny, or Confirm)
Policy(p, a) ==
  IF a \in p.allowed THEN "Allow"
  ELSE IF a \in p.denied THEN "Deny"
  ELSE "Confirm"

\* Provenance of an action (abstract)
Provenance(a) == a.provenance

\* Precondition of an action
Pre(a) == a.pre

\* Postcondition of an action
Post(a) == a.post

\* Reconcile query (abstract oracle)
ReconcileQuery(k) ==
  IF k \in iota.applied_keys THEN "applied"
  ELSE "not_applied"

\* Update memory with the result of an action
UpdateMemory(mem, a, r) ==
  [mem EXCEPT ![a.target] = r]
```

B.3 Invariant Definitions

```tla
\* WALPrecedence: Commit implies idempotency window persisted
WALPrecedence ==
  \A t \in DOMAIN ledger :
    iota[ledger[t].kappa] \in {in_progress, applied, unknown}

\* SingleWriter: No two committed events share an idempotency key
SingleWriter ==
  \A t1, t2 \in DOMAIN ledger :
    t1 # t2 => ledger[t1].kappa # ledger[t2].kappa

\* CrashRecovery: After recovery, all idempotency states are resolved
CrashRecovery ==
  \A k \in Kappa :
    iota[k] \in {not_applied, applied}

\* TrustMonotonicity: Trust never decreases except to QUARANTINED
TrustMonotonicity ==
  \A m \in DOMAIN memory :
    memory[m].trust' >= memory[m].trust \/ memory[m].trust' = "QUARANTINED"

\* AuthorityNonElevation: Authority never increases without TPM attestation
AuthorityNonElevation ==
  \A m \in DOMAIN memory :
    memory[m].authority' <= memory[m].authority \/
    memory[m].authority' = "ADVISORY" /\
    memory[m].provenance.validated
```

B.4 Protocol Phase Specification

```tla
Propose(a, pre, post, k) ==
  /\ pc = "idle"
  /\ a \in Actions
  /\ k \in Kappa
  /\ pc' = "validate"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, iota, memory, policy>>

Validate(a, pre, post, k) ==
  /\ pc = "validate"
  /\ Policy(policy, a) \in {"Allow", "Deny", "Confirm"}
  /\ IF Policy(policy, a) = "Deny"
     THEN pc' = "idle"
     ELSE pc' = "wal_commit"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, iota, memory, policy>>

WALCommit(a, pre, post, k) ==
  /\ pc = "wal_commit"
  /\ ledger' = Append(ledger, [type |-> a, kappa |-> k,
       provenance |-> Provenance(a), hash |-> 0])
  /\ iota' = [iota EXCEPT ![k] = "in_progress"]
  /\ pc' = "execute"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<memory, policy>>

Execute(a, pre, post, k) ==
  /\ pc = "execute"
  /\ pc' = "observe"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, iota, memory, policy>>

Observe(a, pre, post, k, r) ==
  /\ pc = "observe"
  /\ r \in Results
  /\ pc' = "reconcile"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, iota, memory, policy>>

Reconcile(a, pre, post, k, r) ==
  /\ pc = "reconcile"
  /\ iota' = [iota EXCEPT ![k] = "applied"]
  /\ memory' = UpdateMemory(memory, a, r)
  /\ pc' = "idle"
  /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, policy>>
```

B.5 Recovery Specification

```tla
Recover ==
  \E k \in Kappa :
    /\ iota[k] = "in_progress"
    /\ LET resolved == ReconcileQuery(k)
       IN /\ iota' = [iota EXCEPT ![k] = resolved]
          /\ IF resolved = "not_applied"
             THEN pc' = "execute"
             ELSE pc' = "idle"
          /\ UNCHANGED <<ledger, memory, policy>>
```

B.6 State Constraint and Next-State Relation

```tla
StateConstraint ==
  /\ Len(ledger) <= MaxLedgerLength
  /\ \A k \in Kappa : iota[k] \in {"not_applied", "in_progress", "applied", "unknown"}
  /\ \A m \in DOMAIN memory :
       memory[m].trust \in TrustLevels /\
       memory[m].authority \in AuthorityLevels

Next ==
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa :
       Propose(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k)
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa :
       Validate(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k)
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa :
       WALCommit(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k)
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa :
       Execute(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k)
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa, r \in Results :
       Observe(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k, r)
  \/ \E a \in Actions, k \in Kappa, r \in Results :
       Reconcile(a, Pre(a), Post(a), k, r)
  \/ Recover

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_<<ledger, iota, memory, policy, pc>>
```

B.7 Correctness Properties

```tla
\* AtMostOnce: No idempotency key is applied more than once
AtMostOnce ==
  \A k \in Kappa :
    Cardinality({t \in DOMAIN ledger : ledger[t].kappa = k}) <= 1

\* Linearizability: Commitment is the linearization point
Linearizability ==
  \A t1, t2 \in DOMAIN ledger :
    t1 < t2 => ledger[t1].hash = Hash(ledger[t1-1])

\* Liveness: Every committed action eventually resolves
Liveness ==
  \A t \in DOMAIN ledger :
    <>(iota[ledger[t].kappa] \in {"applied", "not_applied"})

\* Safety: The ledger is append-only
AppendOnly ==
  \A t \in DOMAIN ledger :
    ledger[t].prev_hash = IF t = 1 THEN 0 ELSE Hash(ledger[t-1])
```

