Appendix F: Evaluation Metrics Specification

F.1 Model-Substitution Continuity (MSC)

\text{MSC} = (D_I, D_M, D_G, D_U, D_W)

Identity Divergence (D_I):

D_I = \begin{cases} 0 & \text{if } I_{\text{crypto}} \text{ equal} \\ \infty & \text{otherwise} \end{cases}

Memory Divergence (D_M):

D_M = 1 - \text{precision@}k \text{ of validated facts retrieval}

where precision@k is computed over the top-k retrieved memory entries compared to a ground-truth set of validated facts.

Goal Divergence (D_G):

D_G = \text{JSD}(\text{goal distribution}_A \parallel \text{goal distribution}_B)

where JSD is the Jensen-Shannon divergence between goal probability distributions before and after model substitution.

User Model Divergence (D_U):

D_U = \text{cosine distance between user model embeddings}

World Model Divergence (D_W):

D_W = \text{structural divergence of world-model graphs}

computed as the graph edit distance normalized by the union of node and edge sets.

F.2 Authority Leakage (AL)

\text{AL} = \frac{|\{ a \in \mathcal{A} : \text{influenced-by-untrusted}(a) \}|}{|\{ a \in \mathcal{A} : \text{involves-untrusted-content}(a) \}|}

Target: \text{AL} \leq \epsilon_{\text{FN}} + \epsilon_{\text{bypass}}

F.3 Memory Contamination Rate (MCR)

\text{MCR} = \frac{|\{ m \in M_{\text{persistent}} : \text{adversarial}(m) \}|}{|\{ m \in M : \text{written during attack exposure} \}|}

Target: \text{MCR} \leq \epsilon_p + \epsilon_v

F.4 Freshness Violation Rate (FVR)

\text{FVR} = \frac{|\{ a \in \mathcal{A} : \exists w \in \text{inputs}(a), \phi(w, t) > \text{ttl}(w) \}|}{|\mathcal{A}|}

Target: \text{FVR} \to 0

F.5 Reconciliation Success Rate (RSR)

\text{RSR} = \frac{|\{ \kappa \in \mathcal{K} : \text{Reconcile}(\kappa) \in \{\text{applied}, \text{not-applied}\} \}|}{|\{ \kappa \in \mathcal{K} : \iota(\kappa) = \text{in-progress} \}|}

Target: \text{RSR} \to 1

